Hansard Gateway — third-party notices
=====================================

This project contains no vendored third-party code. It does, however, port
one algorithm from a prior-art project:

- The search sweep/dedupe algorithm in `src/hansard_gateway/search/sprs.py`
  (probe the load-balanced `maxResult` totals, sweep 20-row pages, dedupe
  by `reportId` until a no-gain budget is reached) is ported from
  sgparl <https://github.com/wongpeiting/sgparl> by wongpeiting.

  sgparl is licensed CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication). No
  attribution is legally required; this notice is given as good practice.
  The port was independently re-implemented against live SPRS API
  behavior; no sgparl source files are distributed with this project.

